msgstr "カムスパイ\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_058"
msgid "A CamSpy\\n"
msgstr "カムスパイ\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_059"
msgid "Picked up a CamSpy.\\n"
msgstr "カムスパイを回収した\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_060"
msgid "There's no way through while those \\nlasers are active.\\n"
msgstr "こんなレーザーがある間は、先に進めないわ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_061"
msgid "That must be the meeting room up ahead. \\nTime to use the CamSpy.\\n"
msgstr "この先はミーティングルームだわ。\\nカムスパイの出番ね。\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_062"
msgid ""
"The safe's heavily encrypted. \\nThe decoder's gonna take a little "
"longer.\\n"
msgstr "この金庫の暗号はかなり複雑だ。\\nドアコーダでもかなり時間がかかるぞ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_063"
msgid "Time to leave! Let's get to the door I set \\nup earlier.\\n"
msgstr "後は逃げるだけね！\\n前に爆弾をしかけた非常口に急がなきゃ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_064"
msgid "Mission critical object destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な要素が破壊された\\n"

msgctxt "L_DEPO_065"
msgid "Stand back, Joanna. We'll create your escape \\nroute.\\n"
msgstr "脱出しろ、ジョアンナ！\\n非常口を爆破するぞ！\\n"

